      "heading": "The top holds",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs leads the ARC-AGI-2 public board at 88.06, ahead of Yi-Chia Chen's entry at 84.72 and nvbanana at 81.39. Rabbithole, Domdolus Tolus, Majkel1337, ALbert RUehlman, Dawid Kopiczko, ｶﾎｳｼｭｳｾｲ and _hans complete the top ten, every score unchanged from the previous close. The provisional gold line stays at 68.75, the score of 16th-placed ARC Raiders, and the silver and bronze lines at 32.64 and 31.81."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Movement in the second hundred",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "Igor V gained 2.50 to reach 35.28 and rose 56 places to 98th, entering the top hundred. ИТМОНЯ AI B2B 67 SaaS added 0.83 to 35.97 and moved up five places to 91st, and Eesh saxena added 0.28 to 34.72 in 103rd. A recorded overnight score event also took Giovanny Rodríguez from 31.53 to 41.53, from 456th to 65th at the time; that is a dated event, not a net comparison. kibuna was observed rising from 27th to 61.39 after a 4.17 gain."
    },
    {
      "heading": "ARC Mutants and the field",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-mark-barney-fact-0"
      ],
      "text": "ARC Mutants, the entry of Mark Barney, Jack Cole, scizical and sonphamorg on the public roster, holds 63rd at 41.81, unchanged. The board counts 3,305 teams, up 20 from the previous close. The social and discussion scan was not refreshed for this edition; the saved archive is background and does not show silence or a new organizer announcement. The board records public standings and does not say how any team reached its score."
